  "duration": 53.892,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.442,
      "text": "The United States once ignored a fine for littering across Australia.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Skylab and Earth Limb - GPN-2000-001055.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skylab_and_Earth_Limb_-_GPN-2000-001055.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1.8,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 1.8,
          "end": 4.433,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 4.442,
      "end": 10.612,
      "text": "Many believe America's first space station, Skylab, was safely steered into the deep ocean.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Launch of the Skylab Space Station (52849407898).jpg",
        "credit": "NASA on The Commons",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Launch_of_the_Skylab_Space_Station_(52849407898).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 4.433,
          "end": 8.3,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 8.3,
          "end": 10.6,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 10.612,
      "end": 17.007,
      "text": "But in July nineteen seventy-nine, the massive station plummeted through the atmosphere as a fireball.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 10.6,
          "end": 17.0,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.007,
      "end": 23.577,
      "text": "Controllers tried to guide it, but a miscalculation sent flaming debris raining over Western Australia.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Western Australia - November 10, 2013.jpg",
        "credit": "Jeff Schmaltz\nMODIS Land Rapid Response Team,\n\nNASA GSFC",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Western_Australia_-_November_10,_2013.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 17.0,
          "end": 23.567,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 23.577,
      "end": 29.297,
      "text": "Large fragments crashed near the town of Esperance, landing on private properties and roofs.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Vicinity of Spencer or Pink Lake to Esperance Townsite and Bay.jpg",
        "credit": "State Records Office of Western Australia",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vicinity_of_Spencer_or_Pink_Lake_to_Esperance_Townsite_and_Bay.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 23.567,
          "end": 25.7,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 25.7,
          "end": 29.3,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 29.297,
      "end": 35.847,
      "text": "Local officials weren't impressed and issued NASA a real four-hundred-dollar ticket for littering.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Shire of Esperence administration office.jpg",
        "credit": "Loomhigh223555",
        "license": "CC0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shire_of_Esperence_administration_office.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 29.3,
          "end": 33.133,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 33.133,
          "end": 35.833,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 35.847,
      "end": 42.392,
      "text": "NASA ignored the administrative bill for decades until a California radio show heard the story.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Flickr via Openverse",
        "title": "Broadcast booth",
        "credit": "CEThompson",
        "license": "CC BY 2.0",
        "url": "https://www.flickr.com/photos/8102700@N02/52666566393"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 35.833,
          "end": 39.133,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 39.133,
          "end": 42.4,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 42.392,
      "end": 48.817,
      "text": "In two thousand nine, loyal listeners raised the cash and finally settled the astronomical debt.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Skylab2 1974 Issue-10c.jpg",
        "credit": "Bureau of Engraving and Printing",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skylab2_1974_Issue-10c.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 42.4,
          "end": 48.8,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 48.817,
      "end": 53.542,
      "text": "It was a strange end for the station that was fined for littering across Australia.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Skylab and Earth Limb - GPN-2000-001055.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skylab_and_Earth_Limb_-_GPN-2000-001055.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 48.8,
          "end": 53.9,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
